          "name": "Record CLI error details",
          "request": {
            "name": "Record CLI error details",
            "description": {
              "content": "Records detailed error information for a CLI command that failed. The event_id must reference\na valid event from cli_telemetry_events table, otherwise a 400 error is returned.\n\nNote: Authentication required. Team and user information is extracted automatically from the Bearer token.\nThis endpoint is accessible to all authenticated users, including read-only users, to ensure comprehensive telemetry collection.",
